(story title)
	The Antediluvian Weapon
(story author)
	Daniel M. Stelzer
(story blurb)
	A summons from the Duke himself? This has to be serious. It’s rumored that the nearby Duchy of Piostro has unearthed something dangerous: an ancient weapon from before the Deluge. The last agent sent to recover it has disappeared. Now it’s up to you to break in and retrieve the weapon before Piostro can activate it and change warfare forever.
(story noun)
	An archaeological heist
(story release 5)
(story ifid) BBABFE88-986D-495A-B184-669592807F1C

(story credits)
	Written by Daniel Stelzer for Text Adventure Literacy Jam 2026. This game was originally built in one week as a worked example, and the whole process will soon be detailed in a series of theory and craft articles. Stay tuned! (par)
	Thanks to Ada Stelzer \(version 0\), Leon Lin, Drew Cook, Melisande, Joel Burton, rh, baezil \(version 1\), and Melisande again \(versions 2 and 3\) for testing, and dott. Piergiorgio for providing the snippets of Italian!
